# Transmutation spell names + descriptions.
spell-magic_stone = Magic Stone
spell-magic_stone-desc = You channel raw essence into a handful of small pebbles, hardening them into deadly projectiles. The charged stones can be flung or slung to strike a distant foe before their power fades.
spell-lightning_arrow = Lightning Arrow
spell-lightning_arrow-desc = You charge your next ranged shot so the projectile becomes a crackling bolt of lightning on impact, arcing to sear nearby foes as well.
spell-plant_growth = Plant Growth
spell-plant_growth-desc = You flood a patch of ground with surging life force, bursting the vegetation into dense, choking overgrowth. The lush tangle slows anything trying to push through it, and vines can ensnare those who step directly onto them.
spell-control_winds_turbulence = Control Winds
spell-control_winds_turbulence-desc = You seize command of the air around you, whipping it into a churning, ground-level turbulence that fouls footing and slows anyone caught in the gale.
spell-knock = Knock
spell-knock-desc = You gesture at a locked door, chest, or gate from a distance and its lock springs open with a sharp rap, no key required. Some ancient or heavily-warded locks are proof against this trick and must still be opened the old-fashioned way.
spell-floating_disk = Floating Disk
spell-floating_disk-desc = You conjure a disk of shimmering force that hovers at your side, holding station a short distance away and drifting over uneven ground to keep pace with you. It carries whatever is set upon it, but cannot climb higher than you could already stand or wander far from you before winking out of existence.
spell-mage_hand = Mage Hand
spell-mage_hand-desc = You conjure a spectral hand that can grasp a loose object at a short distance, holding it steady or setting it down gently wherever you point. It has no strength to speak of and cannot be used to strike anything.
spell-telekinesis = Telekinesis
spell-telekinesis-desc = You reach out with your mind and seize a loose object well beyond arm's reach, holding it suspended in the air or hurling it with bruising force at whatever you choose.
spell-catapult = Catapult
spell-catapult-desc = You hurl a small loose object at a target with a sudden burst of force, no throwing arm required.
spell-sequester = Sequester
spell-sequester-desc = You wrap yourself in a veil of stillness, turning yourself unseen and shielding yourself from every form of remote sensing.
spell-weave_transfusion = Weave Transfusion
spell-weave_transfusion-desc = You touch a wounded ally and pour a surge of raw vitality into them, closing wounds in an instant.

spell-primal_savagery = Primal Savagery
spell-primal_savagery-desc = Your teeth and nails warp into corrosive fangs and claws for a single strike. A melee spell attack lashes one creature within reach, dissolving flesh with caustic energy.
spell-shillelagh = Shillelagh
spell-shillelagh-desc = A wooden cudgel or staff in your grip drinks in the sap of the wild, swelling with living strength. While the charm holds, you strike with the surety of nature's vigor rather than raw muscle, and the wood bites harder than its size suggests.
spell-thorn_whip = Thorn Whip
spell-thorn_whip-desc = A barbed, living vine erupts from your hand and snaps toward a distant foe, tearing into them with its thorns on a hit.
spell-expeditious_retreat = Expeditious Retreat
spell-expeditious_retreat-desc = Your body surges with unnatural quickness, letting you cover ground far faster than normal for as long as the magic holds.
spell-feather_fall = Feather Fall
spell-feather_fall-desc = Up to five plummeting creatures within range have their fall gentled, drifting downward slowly enough to touch the ground unharmed.
spell-jump = Jump
spell-jump-desc = A surge of springing vigor floods a touched creature's legs, letting them leap far beyond their normal limits for a short while.
spell-longstrider = Longstrider
spell-longstrider-desc = A touched creature's legs surge with tireless vigor, quickening its stride for the rest of the hour.
spell-zephyr_strike = Zephyr Strike
spell-zephyr_strike-desc = You channel the rushing air, letting your stride flow as freely as a gust while the magic lasts.
spell-spider_climb = Spider Climb
spell-spider_climb-desc = A willing creature you touch can cling to and climb walls and ceilings as easily as a hunting spider, hands left free. Surfaces both sheer and overhead hold no fear for the duration.
spell-spike_growth = Spike Growth
spell-spike_growth-desc = The earth within the target zone erupts into a thicket of hardened thorns and jagged spines, turning the ground treacherous. Anyone caught in the bristling area finds their footing snagged and their movement slowed by the spikes.
spell-blink = Blink
spell-blink-desc = For a short time the caster flickers unstably between worlds, periodically slipping into a shadowy parallel plane and reappearing nearby moments later. While phased out, incoming blows land far less solidly against their half-present form.
spell-draconic_stride = Draconic Stride
spell-draconic_stride-desc = Roaring flames erupt from beneath your feet, hurling you forward with explosive speed and scorching the ground in your wake. While the burst lasts your movement surges and you slip past foes without leaving an opening.
spell-elemental_weapon = Elemental Weapon
spell-elemental_weapon-desc = A weapon you touch is wreathed in elemental energy, gaining a keener edge and crackling with a chosen element. While the charm holds, its strikes land truer and sear with acid, frost, flame, lightning, or a thunderous shock.
spell-erupting_earth = Erupting Earth
spell-erupting_earth-desc = A geyser of broken stone and soil bursts upward from a chosen point on the ground, battering everyone nearby and leaving the churned earth difficult to cross. Those caught in the blast take less harm if they react quickly enough to dive aside.
spell-flame_arrows = Flame Arrows
spell-flame_arrows-desc = You imbue a bundle of arrows or bolts with smoldering heat, leaving them ready to ignite on impact. Each enchanted projectile that strikes a foe sears it with an extra burst of flame.
spell-fly = Fly
spell-fly-desc = A touched willing ally is charged with unnatural speed, letting them cross ground far faster than normal for the duration.
spell-gaseous_form = Gaseous Form
spell-gaseous_form-desc = A willing creature you touch turns momentarily indistinct, its edges blurring like drifting mist. While the haze clings to them, blows that would otherwise land solidly instead pass through with far less force.
spell-haste = Haste
spell-haste-desc = You charge a willing ally with surging speed, quickening their steps and sharpening their reflexes while the magic holds.
spell-slow = Slow
spell-slow-desc = You warp the flow of time around several creatures within a chosen area, dragging their actions to a crawl. Caught in the effect, they move sluggishly and react far slower than normal while it lasts.
spell-water_breathing = Water Breathing
spell-water_breathing-desc = Touched by the spell, up to ten willing allies draw breath from the surrounding water as easily as from open air. They keep their usual breathing as well, moving freely between surface and depths.
spell-water_walk = Water Walk
spell-water_walk-desc = The targets' steps firm against any liquid, letting them stride over water, mud, snow, or molten flows as though walking on solid earth.
